    "notes": "Add the Parallel provider for native web-grounded Decision V4 calls using fast or future modes. Preserve typed boolean/choice/score/refusal answers, full precision, shared citations and excerpts, confidence, score legends, decision IDs and usage. Supports configurable endpoint/headers, PARALLEL_API_KEY or explicit/per-request keys, cancellation and structured HTTP errors. Exact 3.0.9 upstream fixture scenarios are translated; JavaScript Workflow serialization is excluded. No existing Swift API changes or paid/live verification."
